# Droidian's kernel-deb embeds firmware blobs into the kernel image via
# CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE, so all *.bin / *.fw / *.csp / *.dsp files under
# this directory must be tracked. Upstream Linux ignores them on the
# assumption they'll come from /lib/firmware at runtime — that's not our
# model here.
#
# What we still ignore: generated assembly/source (gen.S) and the host
# ihex2fw helper produced during build.

*.gen.S
ihex2fw
